\begin{description}
\item[* name:] TPROSUBJdel
\item[* relevant examples:] \'{e}l nada $\rightarrow$ nada
\item[* language:] Spanish
\item[* kind of rule:] M-rule
\item[* subgrammar:] CLAUSEtoSENTENCE
\item[* class:] TC\_deletionrules
\item[* date of creation:] 25-JUL-1988 11:00:00  
\item[* author:] Elly van Munster
\item[* copied from:] --
\item[* modification:]\mbox{}
\begin{enumerate}
\item date: 24/08/88\ \ \ \ \ author: Lisette Appelo
\item date: 25/08/88\ \ \ \ \ author: Lisette Appelo
\item date: 13/03/89\ \ \ \ \ author: Elly van Munster\\
Subrule added for generic subject ("redellosBPERSPROkey").
\item date: 19/10/89\ \ \ \ \ author: Lisette Appelo\\
Added condition/actions for NPhead in subrule for "redellos"
\item date: 08/08/91\ \ \ \ \ author: Elena Pinillos
condition on restructuring added; the pronominal subject of sentences under\\
a causative construction must NOT be deleted
\end{enumerate}
\item[* task:] Deletion of a subject pronoun.
\item[\ \ strategy:] (also: deviations from accepted proposals)
\item[\ \ rejected alternatives:]
\item[\ \ clarification of variables:]
\item[\ \ clarification of the splitting up into subrules:]
\item[\ \ clarification of the collapsing of rules:] (e.g. clarification of parameters)
\item[\ \ differences analytical/generative version:] none
\item[\  \ suggested semantics:]
\item[\ \ presuppositions:]\mbox{}
\begin{enumerate}
