\item[\ \ remarks:]\mbox{}
\begin{enumerate}
\item problems:\\
This filter is added to restrict the output sentences. In fact a Spanish 
sentence with overt personal pronoun in subject-position is not incorrect, 
but less neutral.\\
NB. deletion of "redellosBPERSPROkey" is obligatory (= generic NP).
